apps/admin-web — third-party notices (INT-450)

The admin console adapts design and code from the works below. Nothing is
installed from them: each was ported into this package's own server-rendered
markup (src/ui/charts.tsx) and stylesheet (app/refresh.css), because the
console's CSP admits no inline style and no client script from elsewhere. The
licence of each was read from its raw LICENSE blob on 3 Oct 2026; the
retrieval record (URL, sha256, date) is docs/evidence/INT-450.md.

